## Alerts

The alert definitions in `{{LOGSCALE_PACKAGE}}/alerts` are what fired. When an alert
name is the input, the alert `queryString` is the most precise starting point.
Note the routing. Some alerts go to PagerDuty, some to incident.io.

## Build a runnable search URL

```
https://cloud.humio.com/ctp-eu/search?query=<URL-encoded queryString>&start=15m&live=false&tz=Europe/Berlin
```

Set `start` to the incident window. Substitute `?account`. Presenting the URL plus
the raw query is the answer. Executing it is out of scope.
